# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHITELIST: ignore everything, then allow only our own files. This makes it
# impossible for Crytek assets (extracted cursors, SDK headers) or build
# artifacts to end up in the repository by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!build.ps1
!Main_min.cpp
!cry_min.h
!CrySystem.def
!resource.h
!launcher.rc
!extract_cursors.py
!docs/
!docs/**.md
